Package: roxygen2
Type: Package
Title: Stand-In for 'roxygen2' in the 'docker_setup' Tests
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("IMPACT Docker GUI", "tests", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "tests@example.org")
Description: Has the name of the real 'roxygen2' package and does nothing. The test
    image of the 'docker_setup' tests needs a package of this name, because the model's
    Dockerfile calls it. This stand-in must never be installed outside that test image.
